    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Juc ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl kɛ Kuäär Ög",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kɛ kɔrɛ cuakɔ rɔ riet dup Ba-can. Ɛ jɛn cu Ög kuäär Ba-can käny raar pääthɛ kɔ, kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ diaal nyieenyɛ kɛ kɔ thiekä Ɛ-dhɛ-ri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ ni ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial ɣä jiök i̱, ‘Cu dual kɛ jɛ. Kɛ ɣöö cä ka̱m ji̱ kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ diaal nikɛ wecdɛ. Bikɛ däk ce̱tnikɛ däk ëë däki Thi-yon kuäär ji̱ Ɛ-mor tëë cieŋ kä Ɛc-bon.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä cu Kuoth Nhial Kuothda nɛy lɛni ka̱m Ög, kuäär Ba-can bä, kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ diaal. Cuakɔ kɛ thum ni kɛn diaal a thilɛ mi ci kän kä jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuakɔ wi̱i̱kɛ ka̱n ni kɛn diaal ɛn guäthɔ. Thilɛ wec ɔ ka̱nkɔ ka̱n ɔ kä wi̱i̱kɛ ti jiɛɛn bäkɛl. Rööl Ar-gob kɛɛliw, kuäärä Ög kä Ba-can. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn wi̱i̱ ɛ ti diaal cakɛ muc pa̱nyni ti ba̱r ba̱a̱r kɛnɛ thiekni ti tekɛ do̱o̱pni ti la ga̱k kɛ kɛ. Kɛ wi̱i̱ kɔ̱kiɛn ti ŋuan ti thil pa̱nyni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuakɔ kɛ näk kä cuakɔ kɛ däk, ce̱tkɛ mëë cakɔ lät kä Thi-yon kuäär Ba-can, mëë cuakɔ wi̱i̱ däk, kä cuakɔ wutni kɛ män kɛ gaat näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuakɔ ɣɔk kɛnɛ kuak wec ka̱n ala nyinkɔ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ɛn guäth ɛmɔ cuakɔ mun kua̱ri da̱ŋ rɛw ka̱n, kua̱r ji̱ Ɛ-mor tëë cieŋ taŋ kiɛr Jɔr-dɛn, känɛ ni lo̱o̱lä Ar-non a wä pa̱a̱m Ar-non, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ɛn päm ɛ mɔ cɔl ji̱ Dhi-don ɛ i̱ Thir-yon, kä cɔl ji̱ Ɛ-mor i̱ Thi-nir), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cakɔ wi̱i̱ diaal tin kuer ni kä Gil-yad kɛɛliw kɛnɛ Ba-can kɛɛliw, a räth ni kä Thal-ka kɛnɛ Ɛ-dhɛ-ri, wi̱i̱ kuäärä Ög kä Ba-can ka̱n.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Cu kään ni Ög kuäär Ba-can kä ji̱ Rɛpa. Nɛnɛ, dhaŋdɛ ɛ dhaŋ yieethä bärɛ ɛ jua̱th tetdä da̱ŋ wäl diɔ̱k, päär ɣäp ɣääpdɛ kɛ jua̱th tetdä da̱ŋ bäkɛl. Ŋotdɛ kä Rɛ̈-baa wec ji̱ Am-on.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dho̱r tëë cieŋ nhiam Jɔr-dɛn",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ɛn wa̱nɔ mëë ku nɛy mun ka̱n, cua̱ thok duëël Rɛ-u-ben kɛnɛ thok duëël Gad ka̱m mun in tokɛ ni kä Ä-ro-er min te peek lo̱o̱lä Ar-non, kɛ tha̱a̱ŋ muɔ̱n wi̱i̱ni pa̱a̱m ji̱ Gil-yad kɛnɛ wi̱i̱kɛ kɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tha̱a̱ŋ Gil-yad nikɛ Ba-can kɛɛliw wec kuäärä Ög, ala röl Ar-gob. Cua̱ jɛ ka̱m tha̱a̱ŋ thuɔ̱k duëël Ma-na-thɛ. (Ɛn Ba-can kɛɛliw, cɔal kɛ jɛ i̱ mun ji̱ Rɛpa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ya-ir gat Ma-na-thɛ röl Ar-gob min mɔ Ba-can ka̱n, a räth ni këth rööl ji̱ Gɛ-cur, kɛnɛ röl ji̱ Maaka. Kä cua wec cɔl nikɛ ciötdɛ i̱ wec Ya-ir mäni walɛ.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä cua Ma-kir ka̱m Gil-yad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cua̱ thok duëël Rɛ-u-ben kɛ thok duëël Gad Ka̱m mun in tookɛ ni kä Gil-yad a räth ni lo̱o̱lä Ar-non ala keydiɛn, a lɛnɛ wä ni kiir Ya-bɔk këth ji̱ Am-on. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mäni Ä-ra-ba kɛnɛ Jɔr-dɛn kɛ key bä. Känɛ jɛ ni kä Ki-nɛ-rɛth a räth ni Bar Ä-ra-ba baar in wac pi̱. Piny pa̱a̱m Pi̱dh-ga nhiam ɣɔaa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn guäth ɛmɔ cua̱ yɛ jiök i̱, “Ci Kuoth Nhial Kuothdun yɛ ka̱m ɛn mun ɛmɛ kɛ ɣöö bia ciɛŋ. Kä ɛ wutnikun wä ko̱o̱r kur kiɛɛr kɛɛl kɛ gaat muɔɔrikun duɔth gan I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ mänkun kɛnɛ gaatkun tin tiatni, kɛ ɣɔ̱ɔ̱kun (tin ŋuan tin ŋa̱cä) doth wi̱i̱ni tin cä ka̱m yɛ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amäni mi ci Kuoth Nhial mal ka̱m gaat muɔɔrikun, ce̱tkɛ mɔ te yɛn ɔ. Kä bikɛ mun in ca ka̱mkɛ ɛ Kuoth Nhial Kuothdun ciɛŋ kui̱ kiɛr Jɔr-dɛn. Kɛ kɔrɛ bia cu loc jɔk, kä bia wä cieŋ ni guäth in cä ka̱m yɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä ɛn guäth ɛmɔ cua Jɔ-cua jiök i̱, ‘Ci jɛ nɛn kɛ waŋdu ɛn min ci Kuoth Nhial Kuothdu jɛ lät kä kua̱r da̱ŋ rɛw ɛ ti. Ɛ jɛn min bi Kuoth Nhial ɛ lät kä kuäär kua̱ri diaal tin wi̱i̱ thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu dual kɛ kɛ. Bi Kuoth Nhial Kuothdu ko̱ru tɛ̈r.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pen Muthɛ wä kä Kɛ-naan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn wa̱nɔ cua̱ rɔ goŋ nhiam Kuɔth Nhial wa̱a̱ i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aɣ Kuäär ni Kuoth, ɣän ŋa̱cä jɛ i̱ ci nyuɔth ni kuanydu tuk kä tin gɔw kɛnɛ lätku tin bum. Kɛ ɣöö ɛ kuoth in rɛydiɛn ɔ nhial kiɛ piny dëë lät ti ce̱tkɛ lätku la̱t ɔ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jak ni ɣä kä wä, la̱ŋä ni ji̱, kɛ ɣöö bä mun in gɔaa kui̱ Jɔr-dɛn wä nɛn. Ɛn wec pa̱a̱m in gɔaa kɛnɛ Lɛ-ba-nɔn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö jiäk lɔc Kuɔth Nhial kɛ ɣä kɛ kui̱dun, ɛ jɛn /kenɛ palä liŋɔ. Cuɛ ɣä jiök ɛn Kuoth Nhial, ‘Cɛ thuɔ̱k. Cu rɔ nyɔk kɛ ruac kɛ ɣä kɛ kui̱ kä nɔmɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wër wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m Pi̱dh-ga, guicni jɛ nhiam ɣɔaa kɛnɛ jɔk ɣɔaa kɛ cuec ɣɔaa kɛnɛ cam ɣɔaa, kä guicɛ kɛ wäŋku, kɛ ɣöö /ci bi wä kui̱ Jɔr-dɛn ɛmɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö käni Jɔ-cua, comɛ kä bumɛ, kɛ ɣöö bɛ wä kui̱c ala bööth nɛɛni ti̱ti̱. Kä bɛ kɛ jak kä cieŋkɛ mun in bi nɛn.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuakɔ te wi̱i̱ lo̱o̱lä min carɔ kɛ Beth-pɛ-yor.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
